{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc \"rg -n 'D75[6789]|round 76|76c|slice 2' docs/CURRENT_STATE.md docs/DECISIONS.md | cut -c1-1500\"","aggregated_output":"docs/CURRENT_STATE.md:448:**The one next task: slice 2 of the \"Forecast unavailable\" release, the reader's screen (D758 order; D756's screen check).** The release\ndocs/CURRENT_STATE.md:453:**Slice 1 is built and accepted at $0 (D759).**\ndocs/CURRENT_STATE.md:471:The record of the D758 step:\ndocs/CURRENT_STATE.md:473:**Earlier next task (done, D759): build slice 1 once its design passes council 74 (D758).**\ndocs/CURRENT_STATE.md:475:The record of the D757 step:\ndocs/CURRENT_STATE.md:477:**Earlier next task (done, D758): Alex chooses whether to open release work, and what non-number questions show (D757).** Decided by\ndocs/CURRENT_STATE.md:478:council 73 under D439 (D758): open, and (a).\ndocs/CURRENT_STATE.md:480:The record of the D756 step:\ndocs/CURRENT_STATE.md:482:**Earlier next task (done, D757): when release work opens, a $0 check of the reader's screen for number questions (D756).** On a\ndocs/CURRENT_STATE.md:486:- **Alex closed the v13s judge line at its STOP** (D756: end the line, release with \"Forecast unavailable\"). Nothing from it enters the\ndocs/CURRENT_STATE.md:492:**Earlier next task (done, D756): Alex reads the paid re-send's STOP (D755) and confirms the council's recommendation.** The\ndocs/CURRENT_STATE.md:881:  - stage 0 and slice 2;\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:1100:| D756 | 2026-11-23 | Alex: \"结束这条线，预测暂缺上线\" — the v13s judge line ends at STOP; nothing enters the product (poc-v118 stays); the first release carries D726 (number questions: sources and \"Forecast unavailable\", band, forecast text and history withheld together); next step when release work opens: a $0 check of the reader's screen | in force | `docs/DECISIONS-log.md` |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:1101:| D757 | 2026-11-23 | Toward production: the \"Forecast unavailable\" release design is ready (council 72–72d): one allow-listed release exporter called directly by the builder, release reads nothing else, number question = not an event measure and not a canonical Yes/No pair (unresolved withheld), verified on four stores; gap measured at $0 (every number forecast visible today; Yes/No prose can quote number forecasts); open for Alex: open release work now, and non-number questions' prose (a) none, recommended, or (b) only where no number state was shown | in force | `docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/FORECAST-UNAVAILABLE-DESIGN.md` |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:1102:| D758 | 2026-11-23 | Council 73 under D439 and Alex's delegation (D750): release work for \"Forecast unavailable\" opens locally at $0 (exporter, builder, package check, tests, mutants, $0 release check; nothing committed, published or deployed; POC unchanged); §4 (a): events and Yes/No questions show question, evidence and answer label, no explanation text; v13s checker defects closed won't-fix; order: exporter and package first, reader's screen second; idea path settled in round 74 | in force | `docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r73.md` |\ndocs/DECISIONS.md:1103:| D759 | 2026-11-23 | Slice 1 of the \"Forecast unavailable\" release built and accepted at $0 (design councils 74–74j, build councils 75–75g): allow-listed exporter (number: question, evidence, \"Forecast unavailable\"; event/Yes-No: question, evidence, labels), writer refuses off-list, every field checked against its store, staged check then atomic no-replace publish; 36 tests, 425 suite, 31/32 mutants (32nd equivalent on 3.10), $0 check on four stores passes; nothing committed or published, POC unchanged; next: slice 2, the release page and the old-1/v8 screen check | in force | `docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/RELEASE-CHECK-RESULT.md` |\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
